<description>&lt;p&gt;Israel continues airstrikes and artillery against Hezbollah positions in southern Lebanon while occupying Haddatha under a cease-fire, and Hezbollah responds with guerrilla attacks and drone warfare. Lebanese President Aoun publicly demanded Israeli withdrawal and warned Iran to stop interfering in Lebanon’s affairs. Iraqi forces have struck a compromise with a powerful pro-Iran militia and are set to deploy today to the stronghold of the Iran-backed Kataeb Hezbollah. The conflict caused 4,335 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxOVmF4dmxfdm9CQml4RExHbVgtSU5JZXZWcVRqbXItRFBublBkcHo0aGNQM0wtX05XeEZ2QVJfaVREeEJuVXBHX3U0TW11cEQ0dmlDSkthNGtIRmdnUFJ0UHRTRm9OT0JoQ2d4Q0N2cjVqUDlsZUVJZ1lDbXVPdnZmcllNOHRkcmZZaTFQVXdmZFVVdGd2eTFOSnZBMG1naTZKUnRGZ01sbTJPdEpYNEN4TTllQmJmaDlj0gG-AUFVX3lxTFBMVlpmMDUyNzl2SDhHcms1b2lYOGoyUGZuLTlZZm4zZGd2d2NPaWdxLUdXV1hLYTVRODdNU2hSRjE0MFAyZzB4bngwNk14THo3bEJiVjRqNnBWTmQxNlMzeFdmLTJvRkdpZTgzVXRMRWN5VC1iZnRYWjlMWlJFSXJFVldiSHVJYkxaSS1ITmZ6Y1R5ZWtraVlSRDRJaDZVMXRGazJGaG9CZjUyazJObUlUTWtWRGNNbThuYTVnWnc?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidEFVX3lxTE5lZUpxM2JnOUkyaWMtTjIwNGxMSVhVMVVmS0VMOGlqdHVadUJzNnFkTnIxOVJYZFBWVTZ5MFc5enpPcllHX1ZrQzR1Q0VKekhpemhqc1d2TThNMks2dzhwZzdGMTlJSlRxVHlPUUdlWkZBRHgy?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxNd2NmVkpkOFlUNVlxZF8xVXhKTUpESVZ0Q0pnVllMeUxmbFBGTjl1UjdNSVg0ajhKQ01hVmYzZW1mcWxFa2VCQ0poLUdvSi1GWWtYZFJYTEZicWlBYWZmZ2ZsVzdNNE1YT09yNjVyamhNMGZsbFZwNVBxVjRWeGM1Sno4endBRnVud3JvQVNIVDVyS0ZaWGMwZkp6TXpmTkZTdlNsSEQyOA?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https: